                    "text": "Add an offset to a signal-rate timestamp. Note that this only accepts POSITIVE offsets. We can't go back in time.\n\nThe offset values don't need to be clamped: you can add a number of samples greater than the sample rate and the correct number of seconds will be added to the timestamp."
                }
